Package: sparseMethods
Title: Sparse Vectors Class Methods
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Dana", "Nguyen", , "dananguyen@utexas.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The package implements S4 class with numerous methods for sparse vectors. Sparse 
  vectors are numeric vectors where the majority of the elements are zero. In our methods,
  we do arthimetic methods using sparse representation in order to increase speed. There are
  addition, subtraction, multiplication, and cross product methods for two sparse numeric vectors. There
  is also mean, norm, and standarize methods for one sparse vector.
